    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gohery Properties are delighted to bring to the market beautifully re-designed and fully refurbished 2 bed 2 bath home in the beautiful setting that is Renville Village, nestled between Golf course and park, adjoining Galway Bay and feeding off all the positive energy of the 5-star Hawthorn Hotel and golf resort. The pictures will not do this home justice – it must be viewed to be appreciated. Recent upgrades from a technical perspective include, Chimney re-lined, new granite hearth installed, New triple glazed windows throughout, New front door, All external walls dry-lined with 62.5mm thick insulated plasterboard, Master Bedroom internal walls dry lined with 37.5mm thick insulated plasterboard, 400mm thick insulation to attic spaces, Airtightness tape to all windows and doors, New wall access hatch installed, and attic storage floored in master bedroom, New electric radiators throughout, optional app for remote control, All new sanitary fittings and fixtures, including showers and custom glazed screen, New kitchen and appliances, including integrated bins, pull out corner carousel, quartz worktop, breakfast bar, open shelving, New hot water pump and immersion and controls, Extensive internal refurbishment works to include all new internal glazed doors, all new skirting and architraves, all new flooring, carpet, tiling, all new electrical sockets and switches, modern light fittings, new under stairs utility area, custom built in storage in master bedroom and porch, Hot press enlarged and shelved, Driveway widened to allow for 2 car parking spaces, Landscape works to include granite borders, garden arch, shed and patio, outdoor tap and electrical socket, Lugarde P561 Summerhouse shed"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "2 bed 2 bath property\r\nLarge 2 car driveway\r\nExtends to 74.98 sq mts (807 sq.ft.) accommodation\r\nClever re-design or original layout\r\nFully refurbished to a very high standard\r\nB rating BER\r\nFully fitted modern kitchen\r\nBeautifully finished side garden – private patio area\r\nLocated between the Galway Bay golf resort and Renville Park, close to Sailing club and breathtaking walks in both parklands and seashore\r\nWithin easy commuting distance of Oranmore, Galway City & Motorway / train access"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      }
